		(gr_text "FAB NOTES - FLEX PCB\nORDER AS FLEX PCB / FPC, NOT RIGID FR4 PCB\nBASE MATERIAL: POLYIMIDE FLEX WITH COVERLAY BOTH SIDES\nBOTTOM STIFFENERS: AREAS DEFINED ON STIFFENER_BOTTOM (User.2) LAYER\nEXPORT STIFFENER_BOTTOM AS A SEPARATE GERBER AND CONFIRM IT IN JLCPCB ORDER NOTES\nRECOMMENDED STIFFENER: FR4 OR PI, THICKNESS TO BE CONFIRMED WITH FABRICATOR\nKEEP REPEATED BENDS AWAY FROM STIFFENER EDGES; NO COMPONENTS OR VIAS IN BEND AREAS\nAVOID SOLID COPPER POUR IN REPEATED BEND AREAS; USE ROUTED TRACES OR HATCHED GND IF SHIELDING IS NEEDED"
		(at 100.15 79.9 0)
